data: {"type": "action", "id": "act6", "icon": "web", "title": "Read web page", "results": [{"icon": "", "title": "Page"}], "results_units": "Pages", "ended_at": "2026-08-01T09:00:25.921091Z", "output": "{\"source\": \"firecrawl\", \"url\": \"https://www.example.com\", \"title\": \"DOJO AI - The Intelligent Marketing System\", \"description\": \"DOJO AI watches every channel, tracks your brand, runs your workflows, and acts before you have to. Getting smarter every time.\", \"content\": \"[![Logo](2MbyE3iVnRC3QD2SyCAm244s?width=32&height=32)](https://www.example.com/)\\n\\n[Product](https://www.example.com/#featureone)\\n\\n[Pricing](https://www.example.com/#pricing)\\n\\n[Customers](https://www.example.com/customers)\\n\\n[Blog](https://www.example.com/blog)\\n\\n[Careers](https://www.example.com/careers)\\n\\n[Login](https://app.example.com/login)\\n\\n[Book a demo](https://www.example.com/join)\\n\\n[![Wired magazine logo](mY5CPtGHIkxVGxrf5SFBYvSNE?width=96&height=96)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nWIRED Magazine Top 100 Startups](https://www.linkedin.com/posts/dojo-marketing_dojoai-wired-100hotteststartups-activity-7414258963506016256-aV1T?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_ios&rcm=ACoAAA17uKgBlxZ3mE--yahEVKUD7Z4ToBrqoOM)\\n\\n[![g2 logo](qX1tqpMi1RB0Wl01k5tS0vSzA?width=96&height=96)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nG2.com 4.9 out of 5 stars](https://www.g2.com/products/dojo/reviews)\\n\\n# The intelligent  marketing system\\n\\nDOJO watches every channel, tracks your brand, runs your workflows,\\n\\nand acts before you have to. Getting smarter every time.\\n\\n[Book a demo](https://www.example.com/join)\\n\\n- ![Broadvoice](s2vjFXNZLZlyu1wQvrzSnlxc00?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![morningstar](Usre0LmLJ7oVqD0O8c46Gqu8DL8?width=1974&height=468)\\n\\n- ![pension bee](od5xWawuPIzfXQW4cActcMfJlE?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![](3EUF5GuRl5k4GSuolg4SiI4Y?width=900&height=500)\\n\\n- ![thrudark](l9FY43aeCdtvE7PeAuWQBo798rI?width=419&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Employment hero](J33PLh8pqwfi5W2nm0ZYDcF6w?width=414&height=48)\\n\\n- ![coindesk](ad4pXHKbGZ2wHD1N7TIpDlHdLD8?width=489&height=194)\\n\\n- ![A eleven](qvWy14ra2m9H9FZjSZvxDOT4GE?width=371&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Benuta](GBnL6hRr28LOZ1HOC806bYRpUU?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![DeMellier London](Z8HwH4AqWynrHKnazNjn1tZdpC8?width=807&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Ecologi](SgJfS3zTQXhLdisCN4TMol5520?width=393&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Widn AI](wiVrEezxEf9nusbeqBWVNpDmTc?width=662&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Hubstar](XXOjvHqIR40HV4PtzMMX2GcChQ?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Kuda](YwIyU2Fsy2g7v4SxJc3reQxE3kI?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Relay](Z0Bo4sqEQS9Y5SRtU4ImvHedGx8?width=3483&height=1501)\\n\\n- ![horace](K4GtiVMLL9Q3LkV7TerxX2bHB9k?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![covert swarm](bhboNFPef7mqJw8BY3xHg891CFA?width=2221&height=280)\\n\\n- ![](ZZMIRrh35TOMB2TjH4n0bvCyK4o?width=860&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Broadvoice](s2vjFXNZLZlyu1wQvrzSnlxc00?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![morningstar](Usre0LmLJ7oVqD0O8c46Gqu8DL8?width=1974&height=468)\\n\\n- ![pension bee](od5xWawuPIzfXQW4cActcMfJlE?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![](3EUF5GuRl5k4GSuolg4SiI4Y?width=900&height=500)\\n\\n- ![thrudark](l9FY43aeCdtvE7PeAuWQBo798rI?width=419&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Employment hero](J33PLh8pqwfi5W2nm0ZYDcF6w?width=414&height=48)\\n\\n- ![coindesk](ad4pXHKbGZ2wHD1N7TIpDlHdLD8?width=489&height=194)\\n\\n- ![A eleven](qvWy14ra2m9H9FZjSZvxDOT4GE?width=371&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Benuta](GBnL6hRr28LOZ1HOC806bYRpUU?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![DeMellier London](Z8HwH4AqWynrHKnazNjn1tZdpC8?width=807&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Ecologi](SgJfS3zTQXhLdisCN4TMol5520?width=393&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Widn AI](wiVrEezxEf9nusbeqBWVNpDmTc?width=662&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Hubstar](XXOjvHqIR40HV4PtzMMX2GcChQ?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Kuda](YwIyU2Fsy2g7v4SxJc3reQxE3kI?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Relay](Z0Bo4sqEQS9Y5SRtU4ImvHedGx8?width=3483&height=1501)\\n\\n- ![horace](K4GtiVMLL9Q3LkV7TerxX2bHB9k?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![covert swarm](bhboNFPef7mqJw8BY3xHg891CFA?width=2221&height=280)\\n\\n- ![](ZZMIRrh35TOMB2TjH4n0bvCyK4o?width=860&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Broadvoice](s2vjFXNZLZlyu1wQvrzSnlxc00?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![morningstar](Usre0LmLJ7oVqD0O8c46Gqu8DL8?width=1974&height=468)\\n\\n- ![pension bee](od5xWawuPIzfXQW4cActcMfJlE?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![](3EUF5GuRl5k4GSuolg4SiI4Y?width=900&height=500)\\n\\n- ![thrudark](l9FY43aeCdtvE7PeAuWQBo798rI?width=419&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Employment hero](J33PLh8pqwfi5W2nm0ZYDcF6w?width=414&height=48)\\n\\n- ![coindesk](ad4pXHKbGZ2wHD1N7TIpDlHdLD8?width=489&height=194)\\n\\n- ![A eleven](qvWy14ra2m9H9FZjSZvxDOT4GE?width=371&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Benuta](GBnL6hRr28LOZ1HOC806bYRpUU?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![DeMellier London](Z8HwH4AqWynrHKnazNjn1tZdpC8?width=807&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Ecologi](SgJfS3zTQXhLdisCN4TMol5520?width=393&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Widn AI](wiVrEezxEf9nusbeqBWVNpDmTc?width=662&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Hubstar](XXOjvHqIR40HV4PtzMMX2GcChQ?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Kuda](YwIyU2Fsy2g7v4SxJc3reQxE3kI?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![Relay](Z0Bo4sqEQS9Y5SRtU4ImvHedGx8?width=3483&height=1501)\\n\\n- ![horace](K4GtiVMLL9Q3LkV7TerxX2bHB9k?width=570&height=194)\\n\\n- ![covert swarm](bhboNFPef7mqJw8BY3xHg891CFA?width=2221&height=280)\\n\\n- ![](ZZMIRrh35TOMB2TjH4n0bvCyK4o?width=860&height=194)\\n\\n\\nPROACTIVE DASHBOARD\\n\\n### Ask anything. See everything.\\n\\nEvery channel, one view, always on. Your dashboard monitors what's happening across your entire marketing and surfaces what needs your attention. And when you want to go deeper, just ask.\\n\\n![\\\"Unified Dashboard\\\" DOJO AI cross-channel marketing dashboard displaying key metrics \\u2014 Meta CPM at $28.40, Meta CTR at 1.3%, Google CPA at $42, and LinkedIn CTR at 28% \\u2014 with trend comparisons, a Meta spend-over-time chart highlighting a CPM spike alert, and LinkedIn impressions over time, alongside AI-generated recommendations ranked by impact.](f0gvOH1Tl6A2axn83RHolixJBc?width=5488&height=4304)\\n\\nREVENUE INTELLIGENCE\\n\\n## Marketing and revenue, \\u2028\\u2028  finally in the same room.\\n\\nConnect your CRM or Shopify and revenue signals flow directly into your marketing context. Every lead, every deal, every order becomes part of the graph. DOJO stops optimising for clicks and starts optimising for what actually matters.\\n\\n![A UI mockup showing DOJO's Revenue Intelligence feature. At the top, integration logos for Meta, Google Ads, TikTok, LinkedIn, Shopify, HubSpot, and Salesforce connect via dotted lines to the DOJO logo at the center. Below, a conversational interface shows a user asking \\\"which campaigns drove the most pipeline last quarter?\\\" and DOJO responding \\\"Let me analyze the campaigns, find what drove pipeline, and suggest where to shift spend.\\\" Three result cards follow: one showing analysis of 73 campaigns, one reporting that Google accounts for 63% of deals, and one recommending shifting 15% of Meta budget into Google Ads.](on7Oofiv5RY8s7u5P554LGirQT0?width=1400&height=1260)\\n\\nPRE-BUILT WORKFLOWS\\n\\n## Do in minutes  what used to take days.\\n\\nComplex marketing tasks used to mean hours of setup and coordination. With DOJO, the workflows are pre-built. Just run them, and get on with the work that matters.\\n\\n![DOJO AI Workflows library displaying pre-built marketing playbooks organized into three categories: Audits and Reports (AEO Visibility & Monitoring, Marketing Reporting & Analytics, Media Monitoring & PR Intelligence), Research and Advanced Analytics (Social Listening & Market Research, Sales Prospecting & Account Research, Marketing Mix Modelling), and Brand and Content (Advanced SEO Content Creation, Social Media Content Creation, Personal Branding), each showing estimated run time and difficulty level.  ](UW8YLuQkkUU2UQiUHKFnWgs7o?width=2300&height=1652)\\n\\nSHARED CONTEXT\\n\\n## One source of truth  for your whole team.\\n\\nEvery campaign, every brand mention, and every decision your team has ever made, stored and connected. DOJO builds on it continuously, so every action is grounded in your history, not a blank slate.\\n\\n![DOJO AI shared Library showing a team's centralized marketing knowledge base: a left sidebar with Home, Team space, and pinned folders (Q1 Campaign, SEO Research); a center panel with campaign folders and brand documents including a Q2 Brand Narrative, 2026 Messaging Framework, and Competitor Messaging Analysis; and a right panel showing a CampaignSpendROASTrend report with spend and ROAS data across Google Ads, Meta, LinkedIn, and TikTok campaigns.  ](SHUB8ZZScHz8JKzbVtkqF5lYolA?width=4496&height=2438)\\n\\nON-BRAND CONTENT\\n\\n## Branded content without  leaving the conversation.\\n\\nEvery piece of content DOJO creates already knows your brand voice, your campaign goals, and your latest data. No more briefing from scratch.\\n\\n![DOJO AI conversational interface for a Q1 Campaign Review session: the left panel shows the system analysing brand voice, consulting authentic voice guidelines, and generating three Meta ad copy variations, with a prompt to save or refine the output; the right panel previews the primary ad creative \\u2014 a 1080x1080 feed image reading \\\"Your team is still using 9 tools. None of them talk to each other.\\\" \\u2014 alongside the full headline, body copy, and a \\\"See How It Works\\\" CTA.  ](XyvTfo5RKrIOsMaNceaaeTRSgM?width=4512&height=2851)\\n\\nUSE CASES\\n\\n## One system.  Every marketing function.\\n\\nFrom brand to performance, every marketing function lives inside DOJO. Simple, intelligent, and effective.\\n\\n[Book a demo](https://www.example.com/join)\\n\\nBrand measurement\\n\\nKnow exactly how your brand is perceived, in real time.\\n\\nPerformance marketing\\n\\nMonitor, diagnose, and fix your paid campaigns before they cost you.\\n\\nSEO/AEO\\n\\nRank higher in search engines and show up in AI answers.\\n\\nOrganic channels\\n\\nCreate and publish on-brand content across every channel.\\n\\nPersonal branding\\n\\nBuild a presence that opens doors for you and your business.\\n\\nSales intelligence\\n\\nEnrich leads, find buyers, get signals and close deals.\\n\\nTHE DOJO DIFFERENCE\\n\\n## DOJO's compounding intelligence.\\n\\nBetter data, curated and connected, powers the intelligence. Intelligence that executes, ships and observes, refines the whole system and is able to learn. No other marketing platform works this way.\\n\\n![](MtxkZ3UiPzOzXKqCgN1hqKBHE?width=2248&height=1327)\\n\\nAlways on-capture\\n\\nEvery signal your brand produces flows in continuously. Channel performance, campaign data, competitor movements, sentiment shifts, public conversations. Proprietary connectors and a live crawler mean nothing waits for a manual pull. The graph is always current.\\n\\nLiving graph\\n\\nProactive agents\\n\\nCompounding loop\\n\\nFACTS AND FIGURES\\n\\n## The numbers speak for themselves.  And so do our customers.\\n\\n### 79%\\n\\nDrop in Cost\\nof Acquisition\\n\\n![](jMQ0YSayp3N8geBqtRmAPCZf5ls?width=200&height=44)\\n\\n\\u201cDOJO now replaces 90% of the tasks I'd have expected a middleweight digital marketing specialist to do.\\u201d\\n\\nJulio Taylor, CMO\\n\\n![pensionbee](YWgNfpdL73i8ySA0THRcUP5IQ?width=560&height=169)\\n\\n### 200%\\n\\nIncrease in campaign performance\\n\\n![ecologi](https://framerusercontent.com/images/SXf7KuWdmA7TsBMD2WzNRdrA.webp?width=2003&height=972)\\n\\n\\u201cDOJO acted less like a tool and more like a strategic partner, turning data into decisions.\\u201d\\n\\nMarketer, Yonder\\n\\n![Yonder](GHdIhvYIQkUJ93pAFyh67mLl6s?width=1200&height=334)\\n\\n\\u201cDOJO has brought rigour and science to how we measure brand marketing. Real-time, conversational and actually useful.\\u201d\\n\\nRomney Taylor, CMO\\n\\n![Kuda](JCKidCRDCMaszVnFuPDLncTY?width=5000&height=1116)\\n\\n### 15x\\n\\nFaster reporting\\n\\n![](F1SWVV5d8HJlyUK9WQoPg0Ns7N4?width=644&height=113)\\n\\n\\\"When you couple your tool with a really smart marketer, that's when things really start to happen.\\\"\\n\\nMeghan Bowen, CEO\\n\\n![Refine Labs](wDzcX8KYfcdlta9XVHhKAkH2Q?width=200&height=28)\\n\\n### 40%\\n\\nDrop in CAC\\n\\n![](EYNUnAYX3xyJ9bmoxqu3ioqgoo?width=1280&height=248)\\n\\nWHAT TO EXPECT\\n\\n## Get started in  just 15 minutes.\\n\\nWe'll get you set up and ready to use DOJO today.\\n\\n[Book a demo](https://www.example.com/join)\\n\\nBook a call\\n\\nSchedule in a quick call where and we\\u2019ll let you \\u2028try DOJO AI for 7 days, completely free.\\n\\nConnect your tools\\n\\nWe\\u2019ll help you connect your suite of existing tools and channel APIs, such as Google Ads and Meta\\n\\n![](2rG4yNNOxgJm1lr01orp5Y27UHg?width=384&height=384)\\n\\nGuided onboarding\\n\\nYou\\u2019ll get a personal walkthrough with one of our expert consultants, as well as an invite to our Slack community where you can find more support.\\n\\nSee what DOJO can do\\n\\nDiscover how DOJO instantly adapts to your brand. If you\\u2019re satisfied, we\\u2019ll get in touch and formally welcome you to the DOJO!\\n\\nPRICING\\n\\n## Simple pricing,  tailored to your needs.\\n\\nWhether you're a Challenger or an Enterprise, DOJO's pricing is tailored to your needs.\\n\\nPLANS STARTING FROM\\n\\n##### $499\\n\\n/ mo.\\n\\nNo setup fees\\n\\nZero contract\\n\\n30-min intro call\\n\\n7-day free trial\\n\\n[Book a demo](https://www.example.com/join)\\n\\nFAQ\\n\\n## Frequently asked questions\\n\\n### What is DOJO AI?\\n\\n### Who is DOJO built for?\\n\\n### Is DOJO suitable for marketing agencies?\\n\\n### How does DOJO work with existing tools?\\n\\n### What ROI can I expect?\\n\\n### How does DOJO compare to HubSpot, Jasper, or other AI marketing tools?\\n\\n### Does AI marketing software actually improve over time, or does it reset every session?\\n\\n### How does DOJO handle data security and privacy?\\n\\n## Try DOJO now.\\n\\nJoin over 100+ brands already growing with us.\\n\\n[Book a demo](https://www.example.com/join)\\n\\n[![Dojo AI logomark](6zGAW2VZJuTM3FOqLwNJDaFLzs?width=641&height=639)](https://www.example.com/)\\n\\nOFFICES\\n\\nX Ventures\\n\\nChiswick Business Park\\n\\nW12 7SL London, UK\\n\\nAI Hub\\n\\nR. Jo\\u00e3o Saraiva 38\\n\\n1700-250 Lisbon, Portugal\\n\\nPRODUCT\\n\\n[Features](https://www.example.com/#featureone)\\n\\n[Pricing](https://www.example.com/#pricing)\\n\\nCOMPANY\\n\\n[Home](https://www.example.com/)\\n\\n[Blog](https://www.example.com/blog)\\n\\n[Careers](https://www.example.com/careers)\\n\\n[HIRING](https://www.example.com/careers)\\n\\nLEGAL\\n\\n[Terms of service](https://www.example.com/terms-of-service#main-page)\\n\\n[Privacy policy](https://www.example.com/privacy-policy)\\n\\n[DPA](https://www.example.com/data-processing-agreement)\\n\\n[Cookie settings](https://www.example.com/#)\\n\\nSOCIAL\\n\\n[Twitter (X)](https://x.com/godojoai?lang=en)\\n\\n[LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/company/dojo-marketing)\\n\\n[Youtube](https://www.youtube.com/@DOJOAImOS)\\n\\n\\u00a9 2026 DOJO AI. All rights reserved.\"}", "has_succeeded": true, "artifacts": []}

event: final
data: {"type": "thinking", "id": "t3", "content": "Now I have everything I need:\n1. GSC top 50 queries\n2. Google Ads top 50 keywords by conversions\n3. Homepage copy\n\nLet me now do the analysis:\n\n**Homepage copy key phrases/words:**\n- \"The intelligent marketing system\"\n- \"watches every channel, tracks your brand, runs your workflows, and acts before you have to. Getting smarter every time.\"\n- \"Ask anything. See everything.\" (dashboard section)\n- \"Marketing and revenue, finally in the same room.\" (Revenue Intelligence section)\n- \"Do in minutes what used to take days.\" (Pre-built Workflows)\n- \"One source of truth for your whole team.\" (Shared Context)\n\n\n- \"Branded content without leaving the conversation.\" (On-brand content)\n- \"One system. Every marketing function.\" (Use Cases)\n- \"DOJO's compounding intelligence\" with emphasis on better data, living graphs, and proactive agents\n- Key use cases span brand measurement, performance marketing, SEO/AEO, organic channels, personal branding, and sales intelligence\n- The meta title reinforces \"DOJO AI - The Intelligent Marketing System\" with quick onboarding (\"15 minutes\") and flexible pricing\n- DOJO watches every channel, tracks brands, automates workflows, and acts proactively\n- High-converting ad keywords reveal strong demand for \"marketing intelligence software,\" \"AI marketing intelligence,\" and \"marketing intelligence platform,\" while broader automation terms like \"marketing automation platform\" drive clicks but fewer conversions\n- The homepage uses internal language like \"intelligent,\" \"compounding intelligence,\" \"living graph,\" and \"system of record\" that don't match how searchers actually describe these solutions\n- Organic search data shows \"marketing OS\" and \"marketing operating system\" are gaining traction with decent positioning, suggesting this positioning could be worth testing more prominently\n- The real disconnect is that buyers are searching for \"marketing intelligence platform,\" \"marketing operations platform,\" and \"marketing automation\" — category-level terms that resonate — but the homepage leads with proprietary framing that doesn't align with buyer vocabulary\n\n.\n\n- I need to prioritize the main headline and subheadline first since those carry the most weight, then work through the secondary messaging around analytics, automation, and operations to match what's actually converting in search behavior."}

event: final
