data: {"type": "assistant", "id": "a6", "content": "Here's the full analysis. The findings are sharper than you might expect.\n\n---\n\n## The Core Problem in One Sentence\n\n**DOJO is spending money to attract buyers who use \"marketing intelligence platform\" language, then landing them on a page that doesn't contain those words at all.**\n\n417 out of 426 paid conversions in the last 90 days came from keyword clusters that have zero representation in the homepage headline or subheadline.\n\n---\n\n## The Three Gaps\n\n### Gap 1: High-converting terms invisible on the homepage\n\nThe top 10 converting paid keyword clusters, and their homepage status:\n\n"}

